// Two of its findings were reproduced independently before adoption:
//
//   C2 CONFIRMED against V11: fastOK = fastCoreOK and sessionGate and
//      venueGate and entryTimeOK — no confluenceGate, no pullbackIndexGate,
//      NO v11RiskGovernorOK, with both lanes defaulting true. A locked
//      account could still trade through the fast lane. That is V11's defect
//      and it is the same failure mode as the §8 walkaway: a rule added in
//      one place without auditing every path that reaches an order.
//   C10 CONFIRMED against V11: pushDollarVolume := close * volume, and the
