//      yloc.belowbar / yloc.abovebar, which ignore the y value and hang the
//      label off the candle by a fixed screen offset. The dotted result line
//      beside them is anchored to the real fill prices, so zooming the price
//      scale slid the markers away from the line and the two disagreed about
//      where the trade happened. Both markers now sit at the fill price.
